{"4843670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "KATAVATIS", "steam_appid": 4843670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KATAVATIS</strong> is a first-person exploration game where knowledge, observation, and system manipulation are your main tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into <strong>W.A.R.P.</strong>, an abandoned deep-sea facility built as a last resort to save our dying planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earth Is Being Abandoned</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told us climate collapse was a hoax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told us extreme weather was natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told us the air becoming toxic was manageable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When crops began failing worldwide, they told us the market would adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When food rationing began, they told us it was temporary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every year broke another record. Hotter summers. Colder winters. Rising seas. Hurricanes. Floods. Earthquakes. A whole planet falling apart while billionaires in expensive suits explained us why this was actually fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climate alarmists were wrong, until they weren't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now humanity is fleeing to the Mars colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth is toast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something Happened</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One month ago, your partner <strong>Ari</strong> sent a cryptic message from inside W.A.R.P.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funding was being pulled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The research was being shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something was being hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Ari disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Repair, Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W.A.R.P. has been condemned. Its doors are sealed by pressure systems. Its lower decks are flooded. Its power grid is unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To go deeper, you will need to understand how the facility works and bring its systems back online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a dense, interconnected underwater facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate</strong> power, water, pressure, and restore systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong> through observation, experimentation, and knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> what Ari found before W.A.R.P. went silent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give Earth one last chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843670/extras/749a81c1ef831d5b1cec969ca7954d3e.avif?t=1788175883\" width=740 height=571 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KATAVATIS</strong> is a first-person exploration game where knowledge, observation, and system manipulation are your main tools.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descend into <strong>W.A.R.P.</strong>, an abandoned deep-sea facility built as a last resort to save our dying planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Earth Is Being Abandoned</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told us climate collapse was a hoax.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told us extreme weather was natural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They told us the air becoming toxic was manageable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When crops began failing worldwide, they told us the market would adapt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When food rationing began, they told us it was temporary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every year broke another record. Hotter summers. Colder winters. Rising seas. Hurricanes. Floods. Earthquakes. A whole planet falling apart while billionaires in expensive suits explained us why this was actually fine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climate alarmists were wrong, until they weren't.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now humanity is fleeing to the Mars colonies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Earth is toast.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something Happened</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One month ago, your partner <strong>Ari</strong> sent a cryptic message from inside W.A.R.P.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Funding was being pulled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The research was being shut down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something was being hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then Ari disappeared.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore, Repair, Uncover the Truth</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >W.A.R.P. has been condemned. Its doors are sealed by pressure systems. Its lower decks are flooded. Its power grid is unstable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To go deeper, you will need to understand how the facility works and bring its systems back online.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore</strong> a dense, interconnected underwater facility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate</strong> power, water, pressure, and restore systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress</strong> through observation, experimentation, and knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover</strong> what Ari found before W.A.R.P. went silent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Give Earth one last chance.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843670/extras/749a81c1ef831d5b1cec969ca7954d3e.avif?t=1788175883\" width=740 height=571 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "KATAVATIS is a first-person metroidbrainia about descending into W.A.R.P., an abandoned deep-sea facility built as a last resort to find a solution to save our dying planet.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843670/23bfa529f85a0a7626f99da5cf42c0e3ca8651d9/header.jpg?t=1788175883", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843670/987b97390113455679a10b4e19d56e0d26e322e2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788175883", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4843670/987b97390113455679a10b4e19d56e0d26e322e2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788175883", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100, AMD Ryzen 3 3200G or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</str